{"v":1,"id":"729ac9c7584b","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"Lightning cracks across the sky","s":16.91,"e":20.66},{"t":"A voice rolls like distant thunder","s":20.82,"e":24.65},{"t":"The streets are full of empty eyes","s":24.73,"e":27.77},{"t":"No one looks up anymore","s":27.89,"e":32.71},{"t":"They built their towers high and proud","s":32.79,"e":36.06},{"t":"Covered every wound with gold","s":36.14,"e":38.3},{"t":"But the ground beneath is shaking now","s":38.32,"e":44.44},{"t":"And the old foundations fold","s":44.47,"e":49.24},{"t":"Something’s coming through the dark","s":49.26,"e":53.22},{"t":"Something no one wants to name","s":53.28,"e":57.29},{"t":"You can feel it in your bones","s":57.37,"e":59.6},{"t":"But you still look the other way","s":59.68,"e":63.69},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":63.71,"e":67.66},{"t":"The lamps are burning low","s":67.74,"e":69.33},{"t":"No one remembers the old path","s":69.38,"e":74.84},{"t":"No one wants to know","s":74.96,"e":79.39},{"t":"We keep dancing in the ashes","s":79.51,"e":83.54},{"t":"While the fire crawls closer still","s":83.57,"e":87.85},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":87.93,"e":91.6},{"t":"And the silence grows","s":91.68,"e":97.12},{"t":"Messengers walked through the rain","s":97.14,"e":99.65},{"t":"Carrying words nobody heard","s":99.69,"e":104.84},{"t":"They were pushed into the alleys","s":104.88,"e":107.55},{"t":"Laughed at, cursed, and ignored","s":107.64,"e":112.02},{"t":"The ones who claimed the highest seats","s":112.1,"e":116.33},{"t":"Turned their faces from the truth","s":116.38,"e":120.56},{"t":"They locked the doors and dimmed the lights","s":120.62,"e":123.59},{"t":"And called it peace and youth","s":123.67,"e":125.27},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":125.28,"e":128.14},{"t":"The lamps are burning low","s":128.19,"e":136.6},{"t":"No one remembers the old path","s":136.68,"e":139.31},{"t":"No one wants to know","s":139.43,"e":143.86},{"t":"We keep dancing in the ashes","s":143.98,"e":147.85},{"t":"While the fire crawls closer still","s":147.89,"e":152.31},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":152.39,"e":156.06},{"t":"And the silence grows","s":156.14,"e":157.82},{"t":"Search the houses one by one","s":157.83,"e":165.72},{"t":"Knock on every painted door","s":165.78,"e":169.23},{"t":"Is there anyone still waiting","s":169.35,"e":172.98},{"t":"For the voice they used to know?","s":173.06,"e":176.55},{"t":"The people ask in trembling tones","s":176.61,"e":180.66},{"t":"“Why does the sky feel so cold?","s":179.38,"e":185.17},{"t":"Why do the shadows move so close?”","s":185.23,"e":189.43},{"t":"But the answer was already told","s":189.48,"e":196.7},{"t":"A low wind moves through the ruins","s":196.72,"e":201.22},{"t":"Carrying a sound like weeping","s":201.27,"e":205.21},{"t":"It rises over the broken walls","s":205.33,"e":209.68},{"t":"And settles on the sleeping","s":209.79,"e":212.95},{"t":"Some still refuse to open their eyes","s":213.05,"e":217.02},{"t":"Some still pretend it’s not near","s":217.1,"e":219.65},{"t":"But the hour has already started","s":219.68,"e":225.64},{"t":"And the distance disappears","s":225.72,"e":228.92},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":228.94,"e":232.9},{"t":"The lamps are almost gone","s":232.98,"e":237.21},{"t":"No one remembers the old path","s":237.33,"e":240.0},{"t":"No one wants to know","s":240.12,"e":244.47},{"t":"We keep dancing in the ashes","s":244.59,"e":247.02},{"t":"While the fire takes the hill","s":247.04,"e":253.16},{"t":"The night is getting longer","s":253.22,"e":258.83},{"t":"And the silence grows","s":258.91,"e":266.97},{"t":"Listen…","s":267.06,"e":269.92},{"t":"Can you hear it?","s":270.0,"e":273.76},{"t":"Something is walking closer","s":273.85,"e":276.94},{"t":"Something is calling low","s":276.97,"e":283.32},{"t":"The night is getting longer…","s":283.4,"e":288.11},{"t":"And still no one wants to know","s":288.19,"e":291.26},{"t":"[Fade]","s":290.75,"e":291.94}],"match":null}
